 "headings": [
  {
   "level": 2,
   "text": "I was too late."
  },
  {
   "level": 2,
   "text": "My wife is gone for precisely two nights and three days."
  },
  {
   "level": 2,
   "text": "\"You can't free up your wife to go drown in margaritas and watch the Bachelor at least once over the past two years?\""
  },
  {
   "level": 2,
   "text": "I know this might surprise many of you, but I'm not perfect.  We'll call this a start."
  },
  {
   "level": 2,
   "text": "That's on me."
  },
  {
   "level": 4,
   "text": "Junior Athlete"
  },
  {
   "level": 4,
   "text": "College Athlete"
  },
  {
   "level": 4,
   "text": "20-Something"
  },
  {
   "level": 4,
   "text": "Parent/Master"
  },
  {
   "level": 2,
   "text": "\"But, But, But\""
  },
  {
   "level": 2,
   "text": "It's worth considering that your time as a cyclist is a privilege, and when you have it many times, you don't want it."
  },
  {
   "level": 2,
   "text": "No."
  },
  {
   "level": 2,
   "text": "Thank the people that support your dreams."
  },
  {
   "level": 2,
   "text": "If you want to turbo-charge the effect, do this without asking."
  }
 ],
